# Corpus 20k: corpus data and measurement caches stay on the workstation; full history on the local
# branch archive/corpus-20k-full-history and in rnawiki-backups/corpus-20k-data-2026-09-05/.
# Production is loaded by scripts/corpus-20k/load/materialise.ts reading these local files, and
# scripts/export/dataset.ts never reads data/corpus-20k, so none of it needs to be on GitHub.
# What stays tracked: the summaries, reports, thresholds and decision records that the worklog and
# the specs cite. See data/corpus-20k/README.md for how each directory is regenerated.
