# DDInter 2.0 (Phase 2 source 18) is CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and this repository is public, so the derived
# interaction tables stay on the workstation: pushing them would be redistribution of
# non-commercial data from a commercial project. The manifest, licence capture, request log,
# verification notes and coverage.json remain tracked as the evidence for Gate G2.
data/validation/ddinter/*.parquet
data/revamp/rendered-text/
data/validation/**/*.parquet
data/revamp/fields-v2/
data/revamp/fields-v2-gated/

# Phase 4 rebuild artefacts, on the same rule as data/revamp/fields-v2/ above: they are written
# wholesale by a script from tracked inputs, they run to 900 MB, and the next run rewrites every
# byte. The summaries beside them ARE the evidence and stay tracked, so a reader can check the
# counts without the corpus.
data/revamp/page-blocks/batch-*.ndjson
data/revamp/questions-v2/batch-*.ndjson
data/revamp/render-v5/text/
data/revamp/render-v5/provenance/
data/revamp/render-v5/pages-all.ndjson
data/revamp/derived-v2/
data/revamp/render-v5/
data/revamp/slop-draws/**/pages-full/
data/revamp/page-blocks/
data/revamp/questions-v2/
